# Ticket Handoff & Impact Area Rule

When preparing to hand off a ticket, validate changes, or present a pull request description:

1. **Format the Handoff Summary** using the following structure:
   - **App:** (Which service or component was modified)
   - **Surfaces:** (Which pages, paths, or API flows are affected)
   - **Components / APIs:** (Specific classes, functions, or UI elements changed)
   - **Regression Risk:** (Low/Med/High with reasoning)

2. **Verify Tests:**
   - Assert that corresponding test files have been created or updated.
   - Run the test suite and confirm all tests pass before seeking approval.
   - If tests were explicitly waived by the user, note this under the "Tests" section of the handoff.
